        "id": 175888,
        "name": "Arcanist Lupus",
        "username": "Arcanist_Lupus",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arcanist_lupus/{size}/2169_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-05-17T19:34:48.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I just tried Dual Crowbars + Mindbreaker. &nbsp;Mr. Fixer did damage to each target, and after each instance of damage, Dual Crowbars activated and let me deal another instance to any target I wanted.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Incidentally, it turns out that when Mr. Fixer has Grease Monkey Fist, Dual Crowbars, Harmony, The Seeker, Reckless and the Mindbreaker out all at once, he does frankly ridiculous amounts of damage.&nbsp;</p>",
