        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/j/cdc98d/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2016-05-17T20:24:13.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"Arcanist Lupus\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n Arcanist Lupus:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I just tried Dual Crowbars + Mindbreaker.  Mr. Fixer did damage to each target, and after each instance of damage, Dual Crowbars activated and let me deal another instance to any target I wanted.  Incidentally, it turns out that when Mr. Fixer has Grease Monkey Fist, Dual Crowbars, Harmony, The Seeker, Reckless and the Mindbreaker out all at once, he does frankly ridiculous amounts of damage.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>That’s pretty much what I would expect.</p>",
