      {
        "id": 175892,
        "name": "phantaskippy",
        "username": "phantaskippy",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-05-18T22:36:06.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>What doesn't make sense is how Jackhandle + Crowbars is resolved.</p><p>It seems to apply crowbars first, turning one attack into 2, and then turning each of those attacks into all-non-hero attacks.</p><p>That makes no sense with crowbars normally responding to damage dealt and jackhandle changing the targetting of the attack before it starts hitting people.</p>",
        "post_number": 26,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:59:32.856Z",
