        "created_at": "2016-05-19T00:15:58.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>By the way, it's worth noting that the Jack Handles + Dual Crowbars interaction bases the second row of damage on the first instance of damage you do in the first round. &nbsp;So it's generally a good idea to target someone with no damage reduction first.</p>",
